WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.643
Watch and read: For your likes practice, you enjoy mangoes. Which sentence tells what

00:00:04.643 --> 00:00:05.277
you like?

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:10.319
The answer is: I like mangoes.. Use “I like” to tell what you enjoy.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.886
Watch and read: For your retell practice, read: “Ama found a red ball at the

00:00:15.886 --> 00:00:20.573
playground. Ama gave it back to Kojo. The day ended happily.” Who is the main

00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:20.885
character?

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.817
The answer is: Ama. The character is the person the story is about.
